        "info_text_LaCCqW": {
          "type": "info_text",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Terms & Conditions",
            "content": "<p><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>Acknowledgment and Undertaking to Comply<br/>  with Travel Requirements</strong></span></p><p>By clicking the <strong>\"I Agree and Undertake\" </strong>button below, I acknowledge that I have full legal capacity and hereby declare the following:</p><p>1. I undertake to hold a Saudi passport (or a passport that remains valid for a period of no less than one year) that entitles me to travel to the United Mexican States.</p><p>2. I undertake to submit all official evidence and statutory requirements, regardless of their nature, immediately upon qualifying in the preliminary rounds. Failure to submit such documents shall result in my disqualification from the finals.</p><p>3. If I secure first place and my travel arrangements to Mexico are not completed within the prescribed period of sixty (60) days from the date of the conclusion of the competition, my entitlement to travel shall be forfeited. The organizing entity shall automatically be entitled to promote the contestant ranking immediately after me to take my place in representing the Kingdom internationally, without any liability whatsoever on the organizing entity.</p>"
